  "foaf:name": "Delivering Climate Services for European Seas",
  "sdo:name": "Delivering Climate Services for European Seas",
  "sdo:description": "RIVIERADE improves modelling methods to deliver validated climate services for resilient European seas and coasts over decadal to multi-decadal horizons. It brings together CORDEX and Copernicus Marine Service expertise to implement a pre-operational multi-model framework for producing, downscaling and assessing high-resolution climate predictions and projections. The project will generate harmonized multi-model datasets and demonstrate climate services in the Baltic, Black and Mediterranean Seas at basin, regional and local scales. Stakeholder co-design ensures usability, addressing ocean health, sustainable blue economy and coastal risk. RIVIERADE directly contributes to CoastPredict priorities and the Ocean Decade vision.",
